  <diagram id="ami-factory-in-dev" name="AMI Factory in DEV" data-alt-text="AMI Factory in the DEV account: a daily EventBridge rule runs CodePipeline and CodeBuild, Image Builder bakes encrypted AMIs from the GovTech parent, test hosts are checked and scanned by Inspector, evidence goes to S3, and a clean release sets SSM pointers and shares AMIs with PROD." data-long-description="">
